@TRACE.DBG
!%DEBUG-I-VERIFYICF, entering command procedure TRACE.DBG
! ! TRACE.DBG - debugger commands for TRACE's images (docs/PHASE-41.md,
! ! subtask 1): TRDBGLNK (MACRO/DEBUG, LINK/DEBUG), TRLNKDBG (no DBG
! ! records, LINK/DEBUG), TRDBGTRC (MACRO/DEBUG, a traceback link), and
! ! govax's GVTRACE (MACRO/DEBUG, LINK/DEBUG). The same commands for each
! ! show what each kind of image gives the debugger. Line numbers are
! ! testdata/mar/list/trace.mar's.
! !
! SHOW IMAGE
! image name                      set    base address   end address
!
! DBGSSISHR                       no     0008D600       00090BFF
! DBGTBKMSG                       no     00090C00       0009D1FF
! DEBUG                           no     00023800       0008D5FF
! LIBRTL                          no     00000A00       000237FF
!*TRLNKDBG                        yes    00000200       000009FF
!
! total images: 5                 bytes allocated: 61584
! SHOW MODULE
!module name                     symbols    size
!
!TRACE                           yes         328
!
!total MACRO modules: 1.         bytes allocated: 61592.
! SHOW MODE
!modes: symbolic, line, d_float, noscreen, scroll, nokeypad, dynamic, interrupt, no separate window
!input radix : hexadecimal
!output radix: hexadecimal
! EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION .PC
!TRACE+2:        CALLS    S^#00,L^TRACE\FIRST
! SET MODULE/ALL
! SHOW SYMBOL/ADDRESS * IN TRACE
!routine TRACE
!    address: 00000600, size: 0000001E bytes
! !
!%DEBUG-E-NOSYMBOL, symbol 'HELPER' is not in the symbol table
!%DEBUG-E-NOSYMBOL, symbol 'HELPER' is not in the symbol table
!%DEBUG-E-NOSYMBOL, symbol '%LINE 21' is not in the symbol table
!%DEBUG-E-NOSYMBOL, symbol 'COUNT' is not in the symbol table
! EXAMINE GLOBDATA
!GLOBDATA:       00000050
!%DEBUG-E-NOSYMBOL, symbol 'MAXLEN' is not in the symbol table
!%DEBUG-E-NOACCESSR, no read access to address 00000002
!%DEBUG-E-NOSYMBOL, symbol 'MSG' is not in the symbol table
!%DEBUG-E-NOSYMBOL, symbol 'CONST' is not in the symbol table
!%DEBUG-E-NOSYMBOL, symbol 'COUNT' is not in the symbol table
! SYMBOLIZE SECOND+5
!address 00000632: 
!    TRACE\SECOND+5
!address 00000632: (global)
!    SECOND+5
!%DEBUG-E-NOSYMBOL, symbol 'HELPER' is not in the symbol table
! !
! SET MODE NOSYMBOLIC
!%DEBUG-E-NOSYMBOL, symbol 'HELPER' is not in the symbol table
! SET MODE SYMBOLIC
! !
! SET STEP INSTRUCTION
! STEP
!stepped to TRACE+9: CALLS    S^#00,L^TRACE\SECOND
! STEP
!stepped to TRACE+10: PUSHAQ   L^LEVEL+3FE
! SHOW CALLS
! module name     routine name      line                rel PC           abs PC
!*TRACE           TRACE                                00000010         00000610
!%DEBUG-E-NOSYMBOL, symbol 'HELPER' is not in the symbol table
! SET BREAK SECOND
! GO
!%DEBUG-I-EXITSTATUS, is '%SYSTEM-S-NORMAL, normal successful completion'
! SHOW CALLS
!%DEBUG-E-NOCALLS, no active call frames
! EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION .PC
!%DEBUG-E-NOACCESSR, no read access to address 00000000
! GO
!%DEBUG-E-BADSTARTPC, cannot start from PC 00000000
! SHOW CALLS
!%DEBUG-E-NOCALLS, no active call frames
! EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION .PC
!%DEBUG-E-NOACCESSR, no read access to address 00000000
! CANCEL BREAK/ALL
! GO
!%DEBUG-E-BADSTARTPC, cannot start from PC 00000000
!%DEBUG-I-VERIFYICF, exiting command procedure TRACE.DBG
EXIT
